[I] Qualcomm IPC Router (QRTR) protocol library and utilities

[T] qrtr is the userspace reference implementation for the Linux kernel's
[T] net/qrtr socket family, providing the client library and command-line
[T] utilities used to talk to services on the Qualcomm IPC Router bus found on
[T] Qualcomm SoC based modems and platforms.

[U] https://github.com/linux-msm/qrtr

[A] Sony Mobile Communications Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base

[L] BSD
[V] 1.2

[D] 0c092efea0cb5c4e2d07b36ec01db3c046dcda620bc25982dfc9e696 qrtr-1.2.tar.gz https://github.com/linux-msm/qrtr/archive/v1.2/
